# ==============================================================================
# Compu MSS — Public Inventory Application Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Add these environment variables in your Vercel Project Settings or local .env.local
# IMPORTANT:
# - Use the PUBLIC anonymous key (anon_key) ONLY.
# - NEVER provide the Supabase service_role_key in this public application.
